  "user": "Can I dispute it?",
  "answer": "Yes, it may be possible, but I need to know what happened before I can check eligibility. Each reason code has its own window, and I can't confirm eligibility without a code.\n\nI found TX-0401 on account ACC-1005: EUR 240.00 card payment to **TechMart Online** on 2026-07-20, settled. Your account also shows **TX-0402**, another EUR 240.00 card payment to TechMart Online, on 2026-07-14. If you were charged twice for one purchase, the reason code is most likely **duplicate_charge**.\n\nPlease tell me:\n1. Did you make only one purchase from TechMart Online, or did you intend to pay for two?\n2. If you didn't authorise either payment, the code would be unauthorized_debit or fraud_card_not_present.\n\nOnce you confirm, I'll run the eligibility check for that code. I won't open a dispute until you confirm you want one filed.",
